Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 09:52:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 11/14] Blaze 3.x heat2: authoritative PS3 login response +
 NotifyUserAdded
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

NHL 15 / Madden 25 (heat2) now read their own persona and reach the
"connecting to EA servers" stage instead of failing instantly.

- Blaze3LoginResponse: match the real ConsoleLoginResponse shape from
  ZamboniDevelopment/BlazeSDK. Persona is PDTL{DSNM,XREF,XTYP,LAST,PID,
  STAS}; the old DS2-derived PNAM/DPTS/EXID tags were unreadable by the
  SDK, so it logged straight back out.
- NotifyUserAdded (UserSessions/2): correct two-member shape {DATA,USER}
  reusing the existing UserSessionExtendedData + UserIdentification
  models; replaces the broken Blaze3SessionNotify guess.
- Program.cs: USCL_BLAZE_LISTEN env to run on an internal port so a
  plaintext tap can sit on the advertised 42100 (diagnostic, env-gated).

Known gap: after a valid login reply + NotifyUserAdded, NHL pings then
sends logout(70) without postAuth — SDK login not completing yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
